<title>USA: Coeymans, N.Y., won by National Bank of Coxsackie.</title>
<headline>Coeymans, N.Y., won by National Bank of Coxsackie.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Bank of Coxsackie said it won $1.025 million of Coeymans, N.Y., public improvement bonds, 1996, with a net interest cost of 4.556 percent.</p>
</text>
